| node | depth | leaf | feature | prediction | branches |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 2 |
| 1 | 1 | 0 | 1 | 1 | 3 |
| 2 | 2 | 1 | -1 | 1 | 0 |
| 3 | 2 | 1 | -1 | 1 | 0 |
